<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Access Health upgraded. [CORRECTED 19:59 GMT]</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Access Health upgraded. [CORRECTED 19:59 GMT]</headline>
<text>
<p>(corrects to show an upgrade and not a downgrade)</p>
<p>-- Smith Barney said Monday it upgraded Access Health Inc to outperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares were off 1/4 from 13-3/8.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
